;; JUN-757: transactional signed-roster policy, caller-owned native OS profile.
;; Owner262144: current roster0..32767, managed session32768..65535,
;; candidate/parser65536..163839, candidate roster163840..196607,
;; authenticated raw payload196608..262143. No heap/IO/authority enrollment.
;; Config4096: magic0, authority32, self X25519 public64, minimum version96
;; (u64), self-id length104/tailnet length108, clock floor112(u64), raw UTF8
;; self-id128..1151/tailnet1152..2175. Config must be independently protected
;; and approved; magic bytes do not establish its provenance.
;; Roster32768: header0..511,65 node records96 bytes from512 (self index0),
;; 128 edge records32 bytes from8192, raw string/metadata arena16384..32767.
;; Version/clock/generation are8/16/24(u64); valid32, nodes36, edges40,
;; arena used44, tailnet ref48/52, relays ref56/60, funnels ref64/68,
;; exact raw payload SHA512 identity96..159. Nodes: public0..31, expiry32,
;; id ref40/44, authorized48, has-expiry52, overlay ref56/60, endpoints64/68.
;; Edges: node indices0/4, raw caps ref8/12, raw ports ref16/20.
;; Capacity refusal is explicit: <=64 peers,128 edges,16KiB arena,4096 EDN
;; nodes/depth64. These opt-in bounds are not universal protocol limits.
;; update returns0 refusal/1 new generation/2 exact same-version payload.
;; Refusal preserves current roster+session; transient196608 bytes clear.
;; New version clears all managed session bytes. In-boot monotonic clock,
;; exact same-version identity and configured floor do not supply durable
;; rollback protection, a trusted clock, app consent or a production session.
